{"4544420": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Lord of Lantern", "steam_appid": 4544420, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When truth fades into myth and grace is forgotten, curses once spoken shall then reap what was sown. And in the dark passages of Brightburg, a nameless hero will emerge. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wielding a lantern from a bygone era, navigate the afflicted city. Survive and hide as you encounter horrors and grotesque challenges. Guided by a fellow survivor, use the lantern to fight, solve puzzles, and explore the atmospheric environments that tell stories of their own. Discover the history, beyond ages of mysticism and dynastic disputes, to uncover the lost truth in this stylized survival horror. </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When truth fades into myth and grace is forgotten, curses once spoken shall then reap what was sown. And in the dark passages of Brightburg, a nameless hero will emerge. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wielding a lantern from a bygone era, navigate the afflicted city. Survive and hide as you encounter horrors and grotesque challenges. Guided by a fellow survivor, use the lantern to fight, solve puzzles, and explore the atmospheric environments that tell stories of their own. Discover the history, beyond ages of mysticism and dynastic disputes, to uncover the lost truth in this stylized survival horror. </p>", "short_description": "Wield the lantern. Survive the horrors of the afflicted, solve the puzzles, explore the atmospheric city of Brightburg. Learn the history and uncover hidden truths of the Lightbearer dynasty in this stylized survival horror.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4544420/f38f213754acdaeb434701c08ecae2724f7a55b0/header.jpg?t=1779919794", "capsule_ima